<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Costello to comment on Australian CPI figures.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Costello to comment on Australian CPI figures.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will comment on the September quarter inflation figures at a brief news conference in Melbourne at 12.45 p.m. (0245 GMT) on Wednesday, his office advised reporters.</p>
</text>
